cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CFS: Community Forcing Service"
abstract: >-
  CFS provides a single asynchronous interface to 47 meteorological forcing
  providers for hydrological and land-surface modelling, acquiring, subsetting,
  and harmonizing each to a canonical CF-aligned xarray dataset.
